 
          <p>When I said my farewells to <a href="/post/2026/05/im-sorry-dear-journal-18-its-not-me-its-you/">Book Number Eighteen</a> that for me just didn&rsquo;t have the right proportions, I didn&rsquo;t expect to fill Number Nineteen so quickly. That&rsquo;s 245 unlined Leuchtturm pages from April to October 2026 which must have been a new record! I&rsquo;m happy to have picked up the pace again after months of writing almost nothing. My renewed interest in fountain pens resulting in <a href="/post/2026/09/the-pilot-custom-743-with-fa-nib-review/">a new acquisition</a> might have something to do with it.</p>
<p>
